<title>NETHERLANDS: FORECAST - Dutch October output seen up 3.4 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Dutch October output seen up 3.4 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch October manufacturing production figures are due to be published on Monday. Economists' forecasts are summarised below:</p>
<p>GMT--Date--Period-Indicator------------Consensus--Range----Pvs</p>
<p> 0830 16/12 Oct    Manufac. output m/m  +0.7 pct  0.3/1.5  -0.6</p>
<p> 0830 16/12 Oct    Manufac. output y/y  +3.4 pct  2.5/4.3   2.1</p>
<p>Forecasts contributed by: ABN AMRO, ING, Generale Bank, MeesPierson, Rabobank.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
